    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.poster.avif?t=1752176456\" width=474 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.webm?t=1752176456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.mp4?t=1752176456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to bring this to SteamVR.\u00a0 Inspired by Dead By Daylight and Among Us, <strong>BlackGate</strong> is an asymmetrical multiplayer experience where every player has a unique role to play.\u00a0  Up to 4 Engineers are pit against an alien specimen controlled by a 5th player with one goal: Survival. \ud83d\udc7e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.poster.avif?t=1752176456\" width=488 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.webm?t=1752176456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.mp4?t=1752176456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an engineer, you and your team are sent to repair <strong>BlackGate</strong> station. Your mission is clear: restore power to the station, unlock crucial systems, and most importantly\u2014stay alive. Each engineer plays a crucial role in the survival of their team. \ud83d\udef0\ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.poster.avif?t=1752176456\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.webm?t=1752176456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.mp4?t=1752176456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Alien begins inside the nest deep within the ship, working its way towards its prey. As the specimen, your goal is simple but deadly. You start in a weak, larval form\u2014but every engineer you harm makes you stronger. \ud83d\udc7e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.poster.avif?t=1752176456\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.webm?t=1752176456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.mp4?t=1752176456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Once you evolve, you unlock new abilities\u2014like heightened senses to detect your prey, or faster movement, and deadly attacks. In your final form, you become an unstoppable force, capable of taking on the engineers head-to-head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.poster.avif?t=1752176456\" width=474 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.webm?t=1752176456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/82d0f55e5fb70ca90bae230faa7454b0.mp4?t=1752176456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to bring this to SteamVR.\u00a0 Inspired by Dead By Daylight and Among Us, <strong>BlackGate</strong> is an asymmetrical multiplayer experience where every player has a unique role to play.\u00a0  Up to 4 Engineers are pit against an alien specimen controlled by a 5th player with one goal: Survival. \ud83d\udc7e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.poster.avif?t=1752176456\" width=488 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.webm?t=1752176456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/487d67b569295b2bb61097babbba8b2c.mp4?t=1752176456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an engineer, you and your team are sent to repair <strong>BlackGate</strong> station. Your mission is clear: restore power to the station, unlock crucial systems, and most importantly\u2014stay alive. Each engineer plays a crucial role in the survival of their team. \ud83d\udef0\ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.poster.avif?t=1752176456\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.webm?t=1752176456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/9b4460f214960fe637626e8c6cc97a88.mp4?t=1752176456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Alien begins inside the nest deep within the ship, working its way towards its prey. As the specimen, your goal is simple but deadly. You start in a weak, larval form\u2014but every engineer you harm makes you stronger. \ud83d\udc7e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.poster.avif?t=1752176456\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.webm?t=1752176456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/f74ac882fb295d0d8659eca57cab2a3d.mp4?t=1752176456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Once you evolve, you unlock new abilities\u2014like heightened senses to detect your prey, or faster movement, and deadly attacks. In your final form, you become an unstoppable force, capable of taking on the engineers head-to-head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to BlackGate and Wishlist Now. In this asymmetrical multiplayer experience, every player has a unique role to play, with one ultimate goal: survival. Up to 4 Engineers are pit against an alien specimen controlled by a 5th player. Inspired by Dead By Daylight, Echo Arena, and Among Us.",
